{"body":{"kept":"Whole in the author's words: all seven of the author's utterances, and after each the essence of the session's answer in its own voice, the fuller answers written in the conversation and not kept. Whether each came spoken or typed is the session's reading; one word the dictation misheard is corrected, with what it wrote kept on the word. The work is in its commit: the kernel drawn from a prototype into the engine and the interface's sets worked out by it; the language said as text and written in code by a template; glass's functions named each by one word, with their ids kept, and some written in the language in the field; src/tools/ask.ts, a local engine at the command line, the probe and the read tool retired for it; the wiki brought to it. Each piece was read by fresh agents, a design attacked before it was built, the code read for its tone and bugs, and the command line used cold by an agent knowing nothing else, and what they found was mended; 169 tests pass.","on":"2026-11-10","paths":[{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC13W"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC13X"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC13Y"}],"said":[{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC06Q"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC09J"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0BJ"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0E5"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0F1"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0H7"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0M8"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0Q8"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0QQ"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0S7"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0V6"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC0ZZ"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC11D"},{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC13V"},{"$ref":"1M7374KJ1SA700A"},{"$ref":"1M7374KQGN9N03Q"},{"$ref":"1M7374KXEEM500S"},{"$ref":"1M7374M374CS030"},{"$ref":"1M7374M94F5T005"},{"$ref":"1M7374MENR1B06B"},{"$ref":"1M737MM1GAVW006"},{"$ref":"1M737MM88HNB03C"},{"$ref":"1M737MMEWCMQ01K"},{"$ref":"1M737M3CFCDJ020"},{"$ref":"1M738CRERHDP00Y"},{"$ref":"1M738CRMNVK206W"},{"$ref":"1M739F3CJAYS028"},{"$ref":"1M739F3JNWKX09N"},{"$ref":"1M73BRQ9QG6D00X"},{"$ref":"1M73BRQG73A3033"},{"$ref":"1M73BRQPX4CZ00R"},{"$ref":"1M73BRQXE14X040"},{"$ref":"1M73BRR3Z1CA012"},{"$ref":"1M73BRRA9KVR01K"}],"voice":{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC001"}},"id":"1M7360TVPDXC000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000000"],"name":"An eighth session, kept whole: one language for expressions, the kernel drawn into the engine, and the field read at the command line","prev":"445c220bcbcb1d144dbcd9e4a50fdf39254a801c4ec2b787a9921ec751ea5074"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"1M7360TVPDXC11D"},{"$ref":"1M7374MENR1B06B"},{"$ref":"1M737M3CFCDJ020"},{"$ref":"1M738CRMNVK206W"},{"$ref":"1M739F3JNWKX09N"},{"$ref":"1M73BRRA9KVR01K"}],"opens":"In order, each step grounding the next. The address and the search, and then patterns, were built within the eighth session: find, its facts, its plan, and each store's index in four orders. So first now, the field as arrays: ids as numbers, a store's facts as sorted arrays, kept between calls at the command line, so a whole store's level and the interface's sets are answered by patterns as fast as a narrow question is now, grounded by what ask and the search are asked; with it, a store asked many bindings at once. Then glass's store ships its index beside its blocks, which asks that holding be read from $holds alone, since a mould may stand in another store; and the lexicon becomes a pure function over the field's strings, as the author settled it: a word's lexeme its text normalised, the lexicon their distinct values, where a word is said one clause of the index, and the lexeme holons and the lexicon whole let go, the words staying holons for fidelity. A Term is the deliberate thing: a holon of its own, made where a word matters, so each has a page of its own. Then rules that recurse, where follow stands for them now; and values in records nested in a body as facts. Beside them, the interface, as the eighth session's inspection found it: an expression that gives no set drawn as its value rather than stranding the reader; the menu's functions given the place pressed; look here with a component; one's place kept on going back; the root saying what glass is and where to begin; a statistic, the paper and the lexicon each drawn as what they are; links with an address of their own. Postponed until it is discussed how the store is split into packages, as a module ships its store: the main store's types held twice, the paper's set born apart, the author's lean being that such primitives come from one source package; and a commit that gives a whole two parts of one name refused. As wanted: the statistics the main store declared in an older form said again in the language. Pinned: time and at, streams, programs. The next session begins at the field as arrays, its bootstrap read through ask.","restsOn":["The plan from here","A store answers patterns","An expression drawn as itself"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"1M7360TVPDXC13W","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000007"],"name":"The plan from here","prev":"59fe0e7c498598ac22e19acd4ec52426715575104c290aed4a09e8cc55d10841"}
